blueline: thermal PMU tdev sensors from the PM8998 board thermistors

Apple's PMU tdev/tcal sensors are board thermistors; 0235 fed them SDM845 die
sensors (55-69 C at boot) and thermalmonitord went to serious. Read the PM8998
ADC5 (rev2, SPMI sid 0 0x3100) as qcom-spmi-adc5.c does: xo_therm, 100k NTC
table; battery temperature when the ADC has no reading. Logs channels 0x4c-0x4f
at start. ReportInterval 0 now stops mic1's events.

